<!doctype html><html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= pageTitle %> · RouteX</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"></head><body class="auth-page"><main class="auth-shell single-auth"><section class="auth-panel auth-form-panel"><div class="auth-form-wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Segurança</span><h2>Definir nova senha</h2><p class="muted">Você entrou com uma senha provisória. Crie uma senha pessoal antes de continuar.</p><%- include('partials/messages') %><form method="post" action="/auth/change-password" class="stack-form"><label>Nova senha<input type="password" name="password" minlength="8" required></label><label>Confirmar nova senha<input type="password" name="password2" minlength="8" required></label><button class="button button-primary button-block">Salvar nova senha</button></form></div></section></main></body></html>
